<p><br />
<br />
Thank you so much for your interest in sponsoring &nbsp;blood drives through the American Red Cross! Sponsoring a Blood Drive is a gift for both the sponsor and the blood recipients, and&nbsp;we are so thankful for your commitment to saving lives through blood donation, especially during this time of Emergency Need.</p>

<p>Please look at the two attachments. The first one is our Blood Drive Sign Up sheet. This is to determine what sort of interest you have at your location for donating, and it will help us decide on a goal for your drive. The second attachment is our Successful Blood Drive Guide. This is a simplified, step-by-step guide for success.</p>

<p>Once we determine there is sufficient interest and a time frame, I would need to come out to your location to view where you&nbsp;would be holding the drive to do a site check, as well as to give you some additional information about sponsoring a blood drive. I would only need about thirty&nbsp;minutes of your time. I will be in touch with you in a few days to see what sort of interest you have, and then we can proceed with looking at dates.<br />
<br />
Your commitment to saving lives through blood donation will help patients like Cameron and Olivia, shown below, have a fighting chance.<br />
<br />
Thank you!</p>
